Ghana flag hanging.

00:27:46.800 --> 00:27:49.280
That is where, when I
came, I'd usually sleep.

00:27:49.280 --> 00:27:52.280
It was a place we used
to spread the bugs around

00:27:52.280 --> 00:27:54.600
and then get something
little to just cover yourself

00:27:54.600 --> 00:27:56.160
