00:46:59.800 --> 00:47:01.760
The government of Ghana.

00:47:01.760 --> 00:47:03.840
Who gives all them the
road-ready license?

00:47:03.840 --> 00:47:05.120
The government of Ghana.

00:47:05.120 --> 00:47:07.400
Who is sure that, the
government of Ghana.

00:47:07.400 --> 00:47:08.880
Why should I blame the white man

00:47:08.880 --> 00:47:11.960
who is in this country and
hasn't done anything wrong?

00:47:11.960 --> 00:47:13.880
So is this the blame game?

00:47:13.880 --> 00:47:15.120
You keep shifting the blame,

00:47:15.120 --> 00:47:16.720
but you do not
solve the problem.

00:47:16.720 --> 00:47:19.680
Okay, so let's say it
is not anybody's fault,

00:47:19.680 --> 00:47:21.320
but the thing that's still here,

00:47:21.320 --> 00:47:22.680
if we really want to stop them,

00:47:22.680 --> 00:47:24.360
why are we not fighting them?

00:47:25.560 --> 00:47:29.080
(somber orchestral music)

